  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bf2d7532251303545ab78ab68b00d5cf, type: 3}
  m_Name: 17F02_TerminalSignoffIntro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sequenceId: 17F02_TerminalSignoffIntro
  notes: '17F02 terminal recommendation. Source: HEARTH_Full_Game_Script_Expanded_Native_English_Lobby_Mia_Commentary.md,
    stable marker 17F02_TerminalSignoffIntro. Text is synchronized by Tools/Hearth/Dialogue/Sync
    All Dialogue From Final Script.'
  lines:
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Inspector, this household's stability index has fallen below the warning
      threshold. Based on the fourteen-day pattern and tonight's escalation, the
      seventy-two-hour projection is a prolonged standoff.
    holdSeconds: 10.96132
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Without outside support, separation becomes likely within two weeks.
    holdSeconds: 4.5462265
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Keeping the unit active significantly reduces that risk. The partner-repair
      module has been used in one thousand two hundred eighty-three comparable cases.
    holdSeconds: 9.451886
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Ninety-seven point four percent returned to the safe range.
    holdSeconds: 4.5462265
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: 'Standard disposition is A: restart the unit remotely. The repair module
      will activate automatically and mediate according to company protocol.'
    holdSeconds: 8.697169
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: The household is expected to return to the safe range quickly.
    holdSeconds: 5.3009434
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Option B is an observation period. The unit remains off, and Ben and Claire
      handle the next several days without system support.
    holdSeconds: 9.451886
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Your disposition, Inspector.
    holdSeconds: 2.2820754
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
